    "256 steps of the 96x64 example model; input initialization is excluded; slice/result allocations and cleanup are included.",
    "Full-model correctness uses the separate native/web scalar-reference tests; the timing run checks its sum against the prior validated run.",
    "1024 single-element self-appends to a reserved 65536-element array check that the fallback does not force a whole-source copy.",
    "One warmup followed by seven samples, alternating order; frequency and cache contention can still vary."
